@startuml
title Subfigure: #10 失败时栈保留时序

participant "main loop" as ML
participant "state.stack" as ST
participant "executeMove" as MV

ML -> ST : push(move entry)
note over ST : length=1

ML -> MV : executeMove(entry)
activate MV
MV -> MV : resolve(from)\n✗ AddressError\n  (key '$missing' not found)
note right of MV
  resolve 阶段抛错
  write 永远不执行
  self-pop 也不执行
end note
MV --> ML : throw AddressError
deactivate MV

note over ST : length=1（原地保留）

note right of ST
  main loop 收到 reject 后
  决定 abort 整条 frame
  这条 entry 仍可见供诊断
end note

@enduml
